  "details": "I sometimes launch 2 instances of the game to test how my avatar behaves for others but I always have to keep disconnecting my headset and it is getting very obnoxious to this every single time. People have told me 'just put -novr at the end  so you get VRChat.exe -novr' but it just doesn't work. I'm not sure if I'm just putting -novr in the wrong spot or if it even is '-novr' but I would really like to see this added. This would even help for people launching a world from the website since the batch file in the VRC directory is what is used to launch the game from the website and thus forcing VR to start up if it is detected.",
